{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iPa0tqrbKT1795161215.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>小一入學自行分配學位結果下周一公布。</p><p></p><p>教育局指，今年有32,104名兒童申請公營小學自行分配學位。當中近五成七，即18,148人獲派位，其中約四成五屬「世襲生」，其餘五成半按積分辦法準則分配。</p><p></p><p>教育局提醒，家長下周一上午10時起，可透過電子平台或前往所申請小學查閲結果，並須在下周三或四，到申請小學為子女辦理註冊手續。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.626582+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:37:14.107748+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:18.341076+00:00","content_hash":"c3d14e323e3c9d017c8b549a27b4b81c7dce2be96b7f943efcd0c19629a52fc1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}